## Purity Principle

**Allowed (goal seeding)**:
- `is_checkmate` in feature vector
- [can_deliver_mate](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/paulander/git/recon-lite/src/recon_lite_chess/baseline_teacher.py#88-96) as derived property
- Goal bank as terminal-space prototypes

**Not allowed (mid-level shaping)**:
- Hardcoded `if checkmate: +10` (retire once discovery works)
- Domain-specific scoring preferences
- Handcoded tactical patterns

